WEBVTT

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.540
It's the middle of autumn,

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:38.450
but it's hard to tell when you live
in the Hidden Sand Village.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.170
See you when I get back.

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:42.430
Take care.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.150
Say hi to the Leaf guys for us.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.050
Oh.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.370
Any souvenirs you'd like me to pick up?

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:49.740
Souvenirs?

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:53.130
If I had to pick something,
it'd be one of their local snacks.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.590
Oh yeah, how about some saury fish?

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.060
You can't get saury 
in the Sand Village.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:01.050
Saury?

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:11.060
<b>We're Here to Welcome Gaara!</b>

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:14.020
Gaara's here?!

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:19.960
Yup, we're having a quick meeting
between the two villages.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.310
He arrived this afternoon.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:22.950
That's wonderful!

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.030
I haven't seen him in a while.

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:28.200
Dosukoi, dosukoi!

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.380
I request a match!

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.960
Why does it have to be sumo?!

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.260
As our bodies collide in combat,

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:36.850
we'll grow closer as friends!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:39.370
You didn't collide. You gave him the slip!

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:42.680
And you ended up pushing 
Gaara away instead!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.940
Enough about that.

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:48.390
I want you all to show the 
Kazekage some Leaf hospitality.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:49.800
I'm counting on you.

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:51.350
Yes, sir!

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.510
Meet Gaara with hospitality, huh?

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:57.900
What're you thinking?

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.600
Actually, I think sticking with
standard hospitality is the best course.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.530
Standard hospitality?

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:14.850
Pretty much anyone on earth can 
enjoy a game of Mariko Kart.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:19.370
Yeah, anyone on earth who's 
still in elementary school.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.340
Wait, what the heck is Mariko Kart?!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.420
Of course, I don't want 
to leave anyone out,

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:27.550
so for people like Satou who 
prefer to read quietly,

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.960
I'll prepare a good collection 
of manga, as well.

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:32.150
I understand there are kids like that,

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.060
but who in the world is Satou?!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:39.110
And I'll have Mom whip up some
snacks that everyone can enjoy!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.360
<i>What would you kids like to eat?</i>

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.280
<i>Curry!</i>

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:47.490
Anyone would be terrified of 
a mom who looked like that!

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.760
I guarantee Gaara would 
have a good time!

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.230
It's true that we don't know if Gaara...

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.720
...would like something 
extravagant or uncommon.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.980
Maybe normal is the best way after all.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.200
Okay, let's go buy a game!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.170
Hold it!

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:04.400
Guy Sensei?

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.140
Lee.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.880
I agree that anyone 
would have a good time,

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.640
were they met with such hospitality.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.020
Right, so let's get ready—

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.310
Idiot!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.830
That deserved a punch?!

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.530
Lee!

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.570
What did Lady Tsunade say?!

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:22.780
<i>I want you all to show the 
Kazekage some Leaf hospitality.</i>

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:28.680
Playing Mariko Kart,
reading manga, eating dinner.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:31.250
Do you consider that real hospitality?

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:36.330
Is true hospitality not more like this?

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:45.510
Demonstrating your sense of 
culture as much as possible,

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:49.730
so that your guest really feels how
intelligent and refined you are.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:54.270
You can't feel or sense anything
when you're going completely numb.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.400
A contest of wills between 
the host and the guest,

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.160
that is true hospitality!

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:04.790
Those who experience such battles
can feel it in their hearts!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.610
That's because their hearts are the
only places with any blood left!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:12.020
Gaara won't enjoy something that
anyone off the street could do.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:15.590
You need to use everything you've 
cultivated in your life,

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.520
and hit him with the kind of hospitality 
that only you can provide!

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:20.290
That's the first step to 
becoming a true host!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.980
Everything I've cultivated...

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.010
Hospitality only I can provide...

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:27.470
Okay, I'll do my best!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:31.680
But what can I do that no one else can?

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.300
There's my back story of trying 
to become an elite ninja,

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.870
despite not being able to use ninjutsu,

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:39.240
but beyond that I've got no special traits.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.690
Lee, you have so many it's absurd.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.310
You need a little more self-awareness.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:49.480
Guy Sensei said, 
"Everything you've cultivated."

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:51.230
I'd interpret that as...

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:53.660
...drawing on your experience,
but not trying to overachieve.

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:56.370
I see. Experience.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:01.050
Use the experience points gained
from hours and hours wasted grinding,

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:58.310
Last Boss's Castle

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:02.990
Attack | Dance
Run | Quit

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.000
all so I can finally beat the last boss.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:06.720
Tenten draws near

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:07.260
Not the experience you use 
to gain levels in RPGs!

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:14.550
Maybe the experience of those 
fleeting, bittersweet days,

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:16.830
spent with the girl you 
met over summer vacation.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.630
You don't get to make up 
fake summer romances!

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.820
It's like your brain just downloads
random memories from space!

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:35.260
Hm, this isn't going smoothly...

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:38.750
That's because all this so-called 
experience is made up.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.370
I bet you'd come up with something
if you were a little more realistic.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.290
Realistic?

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.340
Yeah, that's it!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.800
And now it's time to entertain Gaara.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.020
Been a while.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:52.720
It has indeed, Gaara!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:56.370
Today, I will show you my own 
personal brand of hospitality,

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.680
cultivated from all my life's 
experience thus far!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:00.640
I look forward to it.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.220
<i>I wonder if this'll work.</i>

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.650
To start us off, I've set up Mariko Kart.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:11.410
<i>All he could come up with that was
realistic was Mariko Kart again?</i>

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.350
So without further ado, let's do it!

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.970
Kart racing?!

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:17.740
Yes.

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.190
I took your advice and went 
with something realistic.

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:22.840
I didn't mean real karts!

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:26.280
And this isn't cultivated 
from your experiences!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:27.630
What do you mean?

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:31.420
Think back to all the previous episodes.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.330
All the things we've experienced 
in this series...

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.710
All the different types of genjutsu.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.410
They're not genjutsu, they're skits!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:42.810
Let's race, Gaara!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.770
My hot-blooded passion 
will fuel my victory!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:49.110
It's actually fueling him! He's flying!

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.600
I see. It makes no sense,

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.930
but this is simply Leaf hospitality.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:54.890
No, it's not!

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.870
You're just completely 
misinterpreting it, Gaara!

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.030
Nice driving, Gaara.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:19.080
A contest of wills between 
the host and the guest...

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.850
This is true hospitality!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.980
The "contest of wills" was a metaphor!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.590
Atta boy, Lee!

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:28.400
Hit Gaara with something 
only you can do!

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:29.860
Right, Guy Sensei!

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.280
He literally hit him!

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:41.240
Aw, even with the craziness,
at least he was enjoying himself.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.190
Don't fret, Tenten.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:47.770
I set up a Satou-style area 
for just such an occasion.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:50.230
You set this up in real life, too?!

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.320
Neji, would you say something?!

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:53.170
Hey, Lee!

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:55.890
Where's my Fist of the Mole volume 4?!

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.890
Why are you actually reading manga?!

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.910
It makes no sense, but reading manga...

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.830
...in your host's home is 
Leaf hospitality, is it?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.920
And, Gaara, stop accepting 
everything at face value!

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.070
Atta boy, Lee!

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:10.490
Gaara's sure to feel such 
hospitality deep in his heart.

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:12.900
That's assuming this madness 
hasn't numbed his brain!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:20.620
Then again, all that's left now is to
bring Gaara something good to eat.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.270
But that's a tricky task.

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:27.320
Asking a deadpan individual like Gaara...

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.630
...what he'd like to eat is very difficult.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.130
I think we can just ask 
like normal people would.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:33.890
It's all good!

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:37.130
I'm drawing on my wealth of experience!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.600
A coed party?

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.580
I see.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:42.820
At the start of coed parties,

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:44.800
everyone's nervous and it's 
hard to start a conversation.

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:48.100
Talking about your favorite foods 
is the perfect icebreaker.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.230
A party...

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.670
A contest of wills between 
the boys and the girls!

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:55.820
Enough contests of wills!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.530
Why is Gaara one of the girls?

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:03.540
I'm utilizing the full depth of my
experience using Neji in my genjutsu.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.500
You're utilizing the full 
depth of your stupidity!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.430
Nejie baby, what can I get you?

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:12.070
I'll have a bagna càuda!

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.360
<i>This again...</i>

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:14.410
And you, Gaako?

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:15.460
Um...

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.900
<i>Oh yeah, how about some saury fish?</i>

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:21.930
<i>You can't get saury 
in the Sand Village.</i>

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:23.900
Saury?

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:24.970
Saury?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.310
All set, Gaara.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.480
Please, enjoy.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.310
Delicious.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.540
We did it! We did it!

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.380
Thank you for today.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.750
I enjoyed trying something new.

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:57.060
I'm so glad we were able 
to show you a good time!

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:00.350
Me, too. I wasn't sure what was 
gonna happen for a minute.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.970
I wasn't worried for a second.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:07.470
By goofing around together, 
you strengthen your relationships.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:11.050
Nothing else could make that 
saury taste so good.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:13.300
This is the greatest form 
of hospitality there is.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:14.890
Excellent job, Lee.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.990
Guy Sensei!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:19.680
Lee!

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:23.050
Do that later, jeez!

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.590
See you later.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:31.250
Thus, Gaara returned home happy after
experiencing some unusual hospitality.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.690
This is Leaf saury.

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:39.740
Gaara...

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.260
Going to the Leaf's really 
dangerous nowadays...

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:46.060
No one could comprehend the
experiences he brought back.

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:49.980
Perhaps this is why you can 
only get saury in the Leaf?

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.470
Autumn is chock full of seasonal treats.

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:01.710
Is anyone else out there 
partaking a bit too much?

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:06.830
Huh?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.540
Why is this so tight?

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.250
Oh no...

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:36.400
<b>The Ultimate Autumn Diet!</b>

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:39.670
You called for me, Lady Tsunade?

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:40.860
Ah, you're here.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.110
It's about our kunoichi.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:48.230
Those who've been participating in your
recent special training sessions...

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:50.120
...have found them a bit overwhelming.

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:53.330
Can you try to find something 
more appropriate?

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:57.290
Huh? What do they mean 
by "overwhelming," exactly?

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:02.380
Um... Overwhelming, 
you know... too harsh.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:07.080
<i>I can't tell him it's his personality that's
more overwhelming than the exercise.</i>

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:11.150
I must remain true to my convictions.

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:13.350
I absolutely will not change my methods!

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:16.350
If they endure my harsh training...

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.540
...they'll be able to do stuff like this!

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:22.320
This is what I'm talking about!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:26.320
Only being harsh is the wrong way to go.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.530
Sometimes women need a 
little simple kindness!

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:32.980
Simple kindness, is it?

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.810
Everyone ready to order?

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.720
I'll just have an iced tea.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:42.430
Me, too. My stomach's so full.

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:45.010
I'm... not hungry.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.570
Neither am I...

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:48.670
My chest's so full already.

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:50.850
That doesn't seem right...

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:01.520
Hey.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.740
Is everyone on a diet?

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.200
So obvious.

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:11.020
Between the sushi, the matsutake
 mushrooms, and the saury,

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.230
we've had a lot of food-related 
episodes lately.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.720
The writers must be hungry or something.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:17.210
You think that's the problem?

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:21.040
Everything's so delicious that
you can't help but overeat.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.860
I heard that.

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.760
And I've gained **** kilos.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.070
Please, you're fine.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.130
I'm up **** kilos.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:31.750
**** kilos.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:32.600
What about you, Hinata?

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.350
**** **** kilos!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.350
This is bad.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.560
The boys have no tact.
If they found out—

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.530
Emergency!

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:45.510
Sakura put on **** kilos!

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:48.150
To think Tenten's gained **** kilos!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.570
We can't let anyone find out about this!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.620
I swear to protect the girls' secret!

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.580
We'd be doomed. We can't let them know!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.370
Not a single one of them.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.230
<i>Especially Naruto!</i>

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:05.400
That settles it. 
We've gotta lose weight quick.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:06.840
But how?

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.960
We'll just have to be harsh, brutal even.

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.760
Harsh... That's it!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.220
We just need to do some of 
Guy Sensei's special training!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.520
Guy Sensei, huh?

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.430
He's a little too intense for me...

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:22.450
But remember what Kakashi Sensei
said about his radio calisthenics?

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.230
<i>You'd burn off a whole day's worth of...</i>

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.610
<i>...calories if you ran into Guy 
first thing in the morning.</i>

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:29.740
Remember?

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:30.610
True...

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.530
We might even lose a little extra.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.340
Right? So c'mon!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.510
I'll do it.

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.250
Hinata!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:40.460
I'll do whatever it takes 
to lose the weight!

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.670
Then I'm in, too! I wanna get slimmer!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.050
Okay, count me in!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:49.010
That settles it. 
Let's burn the butter, girls!

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:50.500
Fight!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:53.930
Really?

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.890
You want to train with me?

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:56.970
Yes!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.940
We all talked about it and 
came to ask you together!

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:02.350
We want the harshest 
training you can imagine!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.180
Please!

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.550
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:08.140
<i>This isn't what Lady Tsunade said.</i>

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:09.230
<i>Wait a sec!</i>

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.030
<i>Quit slacking!</i>

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:17.370
<i>You'll never beat the 
boys with that attitude!</i>

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:21.810
<i>I see. So he showed no sign 
of changing his attitude.</i>

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:26.000
<i>I can't trust our youth to 
such an inflexible man.</i>

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:28.960
<b>Kakashi 
Might Guy 
Yamato</b>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.680
<i>Might Guy, minus 3 points!</i>

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:32.170
<i>This may be her way of evaluating me.</i>

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:36.930
<i>Very well, I'll follow Lady Tsunade's
order and try things her way.</i>

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.640
Understood!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.620
I'll be happy to train you.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:41.270
Sir!

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:43.310
<i>I will lose this flab!</i>

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.310
<i>Before the boys know anything!</i>

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.310
<i>Gotta lose **** kilos!</i>

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.980
<i>I don't want Naruto to be grossed out!</i>

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:52.890
Okay, for our first exercise...

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.230
Let's see...

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:55.920
Ten push-ups.

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.950
Ten push-ups?!

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.260
Wh-What?

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:02.070
Guy Sensei, are you making fun of us?!

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.070
If that was a joke, it wasn't funny!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:07.390
We wouldn't have come to you
if we wanted something easy!

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:09.150
Make it harsher!

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.910
<i>Wow, they're a little too into this.</i>

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:12.880
O-Okay, in that case...

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.050
Try and keep up with me!

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.600
That's what he calls harsh?!

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.350
They're doing it!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.890
Next, try this!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.740
Why on earth should we do that?!

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:24.630
Don't tell me you can't do it.

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.700
No normal person can do that!

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:29.820
What?! You guys just jumped right in?!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.010
<i>Only being harsh is the wrong way to go.</i>

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:42.520
<i>Sometimes women need a 
little simple kindness!</i>

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:45.940
<i>Simple kindness, right.</i>

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:46.620
<i>Okay.</i>

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:50.700
Great job.

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:54.020
You've earned a break.
Help yourselves to a treat.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:57.300
<i>A carrot and stick policy 
should be just right.</i>

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:00.280
What's the matter?
 Don't you want any?

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:01.970
N-No thank you.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:04.430
Just continue the training, please.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.890
Something tougher!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.100
<i>Wh-What is this?!</i>

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.760
Here's the next exercise. 
Try and keep up!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:14.320
No way. We're not doing the 
Thousand Years of Death.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.030
We are?!

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:22.940
<i>Perhaps they felt too much pressure
to not accept the carrot part.</i>

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:25.250
I should ask Lee for help.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:30.210
Great work, girls!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:32.700
We heard you've been training hard...

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:34.170
So we bought you a little treat!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.800
Go ahead, dig in.

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:42.510
<i>Later on they'll say...</i>

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.930
Wait, you did that, Guy Sensei?

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.400
You're much sweeter than you look!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.230
How manly of you.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.290
<i>An indirect carrot and 
direct stick policy.</i>

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.940
<i>There's no way this will fail.</i>

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.650
W-We're okay...

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:58.400
We're just here to train...

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:01.120
I appreciate the thought,
but you can take this all back.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.120
<i>What?!</i>

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:06.040
<i>Hold on. Am I just overthinking things?</i>

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.810
<i>Do they really and truly...</i>

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:10.320
<i>...just want to train under me
 with no ulterior motive?</i>

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.500
<i>That aura... It's like they're burning!</i>

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:20.930
<i>Now we're talking. I'll take 
them as far as they can go!</i>

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.010
Much too slow!

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:29.630
Hit it back no matter 
where it comes from!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:32.230
If you can't handle this, 
you'll never take the gold!

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:34.920
Hinata!

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.030
Don't help her!

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.740
Stand up on your own.

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:40.410
I know you can do it, Hinata!

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:43.310
Yes. One more round, please!

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:44.580
Please!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.680
Girls...

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:48.500
We're just starting.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.040
Follow me!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.420
We sprint all the way to the ocean!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.320
Yes!

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:54.700
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:57.900
<i>They finally understand my 
hot-blooded passion for training!</i>

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.050
That's what Guy Sensei thought.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.700
<i>I will shed this fat!</i>

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:04.130
<i>I don't understand the 
point of any of this...</i>

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:06.250
<i>And he's way too intense, but...</i>

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:08.390
<i>It's all to get in shape...</i>

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.060
We won't quit!

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:13.480
The results...

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:24.820
I made it!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.390
It was all worth it!

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:29.850
Yes, we did a great job!

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:31.790
We should all be proud!

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:34.500
Yes, indeed you should!

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:36.910
You all endured a lot.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:39.120
Right now, I'm...

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.960
I'm bursting with joy!

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.840
Guy Sensei!

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.140
You fools! What're you crying for?

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.560
Now then...

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:56.730
Everyone eat their fill!

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:59.440
Consider it your reward 
for a job well done.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:03.970
It's good, it's so good!

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:07.090
Thanks for letting us tag along!

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:09.030
Lady Hinata, please, have some!

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.630
The hunger meter's approaching max!

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.390
Batten down the hatches 
on the port side!

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.150
The third line's been breached!

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:20.400
The fourth line won't hold!

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.090
It's over! We can't hold out anymore!

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:25.800
No...

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:27.630
At this rate...

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:35.960
And so, they instantly rebounded,

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:38.460
and the ultimate autumn 
diet ended in failure.

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:43.080
Guy Sensei will never understand the
fickle hearts of young women.

00:23:20.990 --> 00:23:23.890
Next week is "Autumn 
Shinobi Safety Lessons!"

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:27.020
<b>Autumn Shinobi Safety Lessons!
Deidara's Art is Always a Blast!</b>

00:23:23.890 --> 00:23:26.740
and "Deidara's Art is Always a Blast!"

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:28.300
Let's meet it with youth and vigor!

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:31.090
I'm done with vigor. I'll just rebound again!

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:34.060
And explosions are dangerous, 
we'll just get hurt!

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.090
A blast is just what we need!

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:39.940
Come with me, and we'll blast them
with the flames of our youth!

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:41.690
That again?

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:44.400
I'm done being youthful with 
you crazy-intense people!

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:45.690
It doesn't matter what you say,

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:48.690
Guy Sensei's mind is always 
exploding with something!
